@startuml Flight_Booking_Flow
title Flight Booking (UC#5) — FLIGHT_SELECTION Phase

actor Traveler
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend" as Backend
participant "Amadeus API" as Amadeus
participant "Database" as DB

== FLIGHT_SELECTION: Search Flights ==

Traveler -> App: Provide departure city and dates
activate App

App -> Backend: Search flights\n{departure, destination, dates, cabin_class}
activate Backend

Backend -> Amadeus: Query available flight offers
activate Amadeus
Amadeus --> Backend: Available flights with pricing
deactivate Amadeus

Backend --> App: Flight options listed
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Display available flights
deactivate App

== FLIGHT_SELECTION: Select and Confirm ==

Traveler -> App: Select a specific flight
activate App

App -> Backend: Confirm flight selection
activate Backend

Backend -> Amadeus: Price the offer (test environment)
activate Amadeus

alt Pricing confirmed
  Amadeus --> Backend: Priced offer
  deactivate Amadeus

  Backend -> Backend: Store flight offer in session
  Backend --> App: Flight selected, proceed to hotels
  deactivate Backend

  App --> Traveler: "Flight saved! Now, let's find you accommodation"
  deactivate App

else Pricing unavailable (test env fallback)
  Amadeus --> Backend: Pricing failed
  deactivate Amadeus

  Backend -> Backend: Use raw offer (simulation fallback)
  Backend --> App: Flight noted, proceed to hotels
  deactivate Backend

  App --> Traveler: Flight noted, moving to hotels
  deactivate App
end

Note right of Backend: Transition to HOTEL_SELECTION phase

@enduml
